id: 12
hanzi: 摄影师
pinyin: shè yǐng shī
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Noun

meanings_summary:
  en: photographer; cinematographer; cameraman
  es: fotógrafo; camarógrafo; operador de cámara

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Noun | Standard | a professional who operates cameras to take still photographs or film motion pictures | profesional que opera cámaras para tomar fotografías fijas o rodar películas | 专业摄影师 (professional photographer)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 野生动物摄影师在茫茫雪原耐心地潜伏了三天，终于拍摄到雪豹奔跑的珍贵瞬间。 | Yěshēng dòngwù shèyǐngshī zài mángmáng xuěyuán nàixīn de qiánfú le sān tiān, zhōngyú pāishè dào xuěbào bēnpǎo de zhēnguì shùnjiān. | The wildlife photographer staked out the snowy plateau for three days, finally filming the precious moment of a snow leopard sprinting. | El fotógrafo de fauna silvestre acechó tres días en la estepa nevada, captando al fin el instante irrepetible de un leopardo de las nieves corriendo.
  #2 | 这位年轻的摄影师凭借独特的光影构图，斩获了国际摄影大赛金奖。 | Zhè wèi niánqīng de shèyǐngshī píngjiè dútè de guāngyǐng gòutú, zhǎnhuò le guójì shèyǐng dàsài jīnjiǎng. | With his unique lighting and composition, this young photographer won the gold prize at the international photography competition. | Este joven fotógrafo cosechó el premio de oro en el certamen internacional gracias a su original composición de luces y sombras.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  专业摄影师 | professional photographer
