  跃然纸上 | yuè rán zhǐ shàng | leap off the page; vividly presented
  捕捉瞬间 | bǔ zhuō shùn jiān | capture fleeting, critical moments
  匠心独运 | jiàng xīn dú yùn | exquisite artistic craftsmanship and originality

character_decomposition[3]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,meaning_es,radical,radical_meaning_en,meaning_component,sound_component,stroke_count,composition_type,etymology_and_mnemonic,visual_mnemonic_story_en,visual_mnemonic_story_es,tone_mnemonic_anchor,cangjie,traditional}:
  摄 | shè | absorb; capture; take photo; act for | absorber; captar; fotografiar; asumir | 扌 | hand | 扌 (hand action) | 聑 (dié/shè, multiple ears / phonetic) | 13 | 左右结构 | Hand radical 扌 combined with three ears 聑; originally gathering sounds and sights by hand, extended to photo-recording. | A hand (扌) captures sights and sounds from listening ears (聑) through a camera lens (摄). | Una mano (扌) recoge imágenes y susurros de oídos atentos (聑) a través de una lente (摄). | 51 | QSJJ | 攝
  影 | yǐng | shadow; image; film; reflection | sombra; imagen; película; reflejo | 彡 | bristle / pattern | 彡 (rays/patterns of light and shade) | 景 (jǐng, scenery/sunshine / phonetic) | 15 | 左右结构 | Sunlight over a pavilion 景 casting decorative shadow streaks 彡; represents shadow, image, or movie. | Sun shining on bright scenery (景) casts delicate shadow rays (彡) creating photographic imagery (影). | El sol sobre el paisaje (景) proyecta haces de sombra (彡) engendrando la imagen fotográfica (影). | 214 | AFHHH | ""
